    <item>
      <title>High-End Computing</title>
      <link>https://lisn-lab.org/facilities/hec/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 07 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://lisn-lab.org/facilities/hec/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Large-scale analysis of brain recordings, bodily signals, and computational models runs on Lancaster University&amp;rsquo;s &lt;a href=&#34;https://lancaster-hec.readthedocs.io/en/latest/index.html&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;High End Computing (HEC) Cluster&lt;/a&gt;. With more than 14,000 computing cores and dedicated GPUs, the cluster supports our machine-learning tools for detecting spontaneous inner speech and our simulations of self-talking cognitive models.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
    </item>
    
